g> and by\u00a0<strong>completing objectives</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499540/extras/19c4361e7d5127c679528319964ec762.poster.avif?t=1773430894\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499540/extras/19c4361e7d5127c679528319964ec762.webm?t=1773430894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499540/extras/19c4361e7d5127c679528319964ec762.mp4?t=1773430894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is a combo?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combos are defined by a sequence of 3 directions and a reward for pulling them off.</strong>  <br>Each weapon attacks in one of 8 directions, and you can execute a combo by placing them in your deck in the correct order.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 categories of weapons, with a total of 44 weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 collectable buffs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >448 combos with 4 different special rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 difficulty settings to make your runs even more interesting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499540/extras/02d4f13437ceba06eb4d7e4ab6594925.poster.avif?t=1773430894\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499540/extras/02d4f13437ceba06eb4d7e4ab6594925.webm?t=1773430894\" type